(829, 'SupportArchmage', '', 11010, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Supports spell skills that deal damage with hits and have no reservation. Cannot support arcane skills, Brand skills, Orb skills, Vaal skills, or skills used by totems, traps or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions.', '', '[2,46,11,16,4]', 14719, 5),
